  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The revised project development objectives are to: (a) increase utilization and improve the quality of maternal and child health services in targeted rural areas of  the Recipient&#x2019;s territory; and (b) provide emergency health services to the general population.</narrative>
  </description>
